---
const links = ["문서", "GitHub", "보안", "문의"];
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="section-shell footer__inner">
    <div>
      <strong>Vooster</strong>
      <p>요구사항과 테스트가 같은 방향을 보게 하는 한국어 개발 작업실입니다.</p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="푸터 링크">
      {
        links.map((link) => (
          <a href="/">{link}</a>
        ))
      }
    </nav>
    <small>© 2026 Vooster. 모든 권리 보유.</small>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    padding: 42px 0;
    background: #111815;
    color: #fffaf1;
  }

  .footer__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  strong {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  p {
    max-width: 470px;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: #cddbd4;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  a {
    color: #d7e3dc;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  small {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    color: #9ca9a2;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .footer__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    nav {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
